      47.85,
      372.97,
      539.93,
      417.04
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance and Mass Media of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order imposein respect of the commodity specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto, a Special Commodity Levy at the rate specifiedin the corresponding entry in Column II of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      429.01,
      539.91,
      451.0
    ],
    "text": "This Order shall be valid for a period of 03 months commencing from February 08, 2019, subject to provisionsof Sub Section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      462.97,
      539.9,
      496.0
    ],
    "text": "The Order made under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007 and published in theExtraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2100/2 of 03.12.2018 in respect of Potatoes classifiable under the HS Code0701.90 is rescinded with effect from February 08, 2019.",
